cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RidgeFill, please cite it as below."
title: RidgeFill
abstract: >-
  Long-prompt prefill acceleration for radiance: closed-form ridge maps predict the late layers'
  inputs for bulk prompt tokens, so each late layer writes its own K/V and recurrent state while
  an exact tail, exact-row selection and a recurrent-state correction keep the answer exact-quality.
